<title>SINGAPORE: SIMEX Brent closed until Tuesday for holiday.</title>
<headline>SIMEX Brent closed until Tuesday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brent market on SIMEX is closed on Friday to mark the Good Friday holiday.</p>
<p>SIMEX Brent will resume trading on Tuesday. It closes in line with the U.K. holidays taken by the International Petroleum Exchange (IPE) in London.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
